# Jr: an all-four reset with the heal, and nothing else (run it before each pair job: J2r, J3r)
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the TP4 bring-up (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env, commit, and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig,
# a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# Duration (estimate, wall clock; the workflow's step limits in parentheses): reset 3-12 min, heal to 3 min more (step 30).
# Why it exists: links train only at board init, so every four-card job resets all four boards together, and a pair-only
# reset (C2_CARDS=pair, reset) would leave the pair's links to the other two boards untrained on this full-mesh cabling.
# The pair jobs (J2r, J3r) therefore carry no reset of their own: run this job, then the pair job straight after it.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-1
C2_PROFILE=general-tp4
